リエイティブ産業戦略2026」を取りまとめました!\n＼\n2033年日本発コンテンツの海外売上高20兆円に向けて、官民で取組を加速。構造改革と一体で、大規模・長期・戦略的に人材育成、製作、海外展開、海賊版対策等の成長投資を後押しし、民間の「売上3倍・投資3倍」を促します。#IP360","id_str":"2090376948073840720","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","quote_count":12,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":61,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"266566401"},"rest_id":"2090376948073840720","source":"<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"32731","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}}},{"entryId":"list-conversation-2090725421594181716-tweet-2090376949869015239","item":{"clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","card":{"rest_id":"https://t.co/lGaGeNpa8o"},"cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":295},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1440464873708605443/Bw8DmKFs_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/266566401/1667205513"},"core":{"created_at":"Tue Mar 15 12:52:50 +0000 2011","name":"経済産業省","screen_name":"meti_NIPPON"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjoyNjY1NjY0MDE=","is_blue_verified":false,"location":{"location":"東京都千代田区霞が関１－３－１"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":true},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{"tweet_ids_str":["2085952779030499393"]},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"経済産業省の公式アカウントです。災害関連投稿は「#meti_saigai」 、 大臣動静は 「#meti_daijin 」で抽出ください。英語版Xはこちら @METI_JPN。\n公式インスタはこちら《https://t.co/XBW3ZNrTnn》","entities":{"description":{"urls":[{"dis